/*
 * Poco M5s (rosemary): board nodes of the sensors area (poco-m5s/plan-full-phone.md).
 * Included at the end of mt6785-xiaomi-rosemary.dts.
 *
 * The sensors of this phone have no nodes of their own here: all five sit behind
 * the SCP on its private I2C buses, so the nodes that matter are the SCP and its
 * sensor hub, and they live in mt6785-xiaomi-rosemary-scp.dtsi (the SCP area's
 * file, which also carries the sensor ring's reserved memory).  This file stays
 * as the area's anchor for anything that does turn up on an AP bus.
 */
